scope one Caravan design study measured and written, the lane's card moved to it, and a crux handed to BAKERY as three bounded compile-time moves
status GREEN -- hot roster 184 guards, 179 green, 2 red, 3 gated at custody. Both reds are mine and both closed by hand before the commit: fold_shelf_link_repoint (my new shelf's two depth-lost links, repointed, witness GREEN on re-run) and standing_equipment, which is derivative and reds while any red stands. index_row_bound went 2 misordered to 0 on the cold pass by the same hand. The study grades A/94 at Field, 3 of 3 cited paths resolving, ASCII clean; every figure re-counted at this stamp from the commands the page quotes.
recommend keep-going -- the study's move one wants Caravan's own judgment, so the lane's next crux is a different one: whether the same wait-name-edge-assert shape holds outside time, at the byte and count bounds Tally declares, where the covered quantity may already be named
